  "problem": "Which of the following matrices have a rank of $5?$\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
